WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:05.480
I had not taken home economics in high school until I was in my senior year.

2
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.900
Junior or senior year, I can’t remember which.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:13.280
But I always enjoyed cooking and sewing at home.

4
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.360
And again I had this interest in math at the time,

5
00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.860
and I didn’t know whether I was going to major in math or not . . . when I walked into the gym,

6
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.880
the home ec table was closer [laughs] . . . But anyway, I ended up at the home ec table.
